{assertion, riak_core_handoff_manager, {587, 11, "32cc95"}, assert_pattern, "{ok, _}", body_exhaustiveness}.
%% the guard is_number(N) lets a float through, field size of handoff_status says non_neg_integer(); with is_integer/1 the range
