{exception, riak_core_ring, reconcile_next, 2, [ignore], fun_partial}.
%% the fun for lists:zipwith/3 takes two entries with the same Idx only; substitute/3 has made the second list so. annotate_type
%% on the fun: not all cases are covered
{exception, riak_core_ring, reconcile_divergent_next, 2, [ignore], fun_partial}.
%% field rvsn is vclock:vclock() or undefined, given to vclock:descends/2
{exception, riak_core_ring, reconcile_ring, 3, [ignore], record_undefined}.
%% the clauses (_, leaving) and (_, _) are dead, the six clauses on the first argument before them cover member_status()
